  "body": "Held by one family for twenty years, this 1910s villa on Domain Street has been cared for in all the ways that matter. Quietly positioned in one of Devonport's most sought after streets, it combines character, space and elevated sea views that feel a world away from the road below.\r\n\r\nHome features:\r\n\r\n* Five bedrooms\r\n* Four bathrooms\r\n* Three living areas\r\n* Single garage with internal access, plus off-street parking\r\n* Light-filled kitchen and dining area\r\n* Mature garden full of birdsong, and room for a pool (subject to council consent)\r\n* Two decks, including wide harbour views from the upper deck\r\n* Heat pumps and underfloor heating\r\n* Minutes from Cheltenham and Torpedo Bay beaches and an easy walk to the village\r\n* Zoned for Takapuna Grammar and Devonport Primary schools\r\n\r\nAfter two decades, the owners are ready for the next chapter - this is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial Devonport home with character, comfort and room to grow. Some homes need to be experienced in person. This is one of them.\r\n\r\nPriced at $2,775,000 - $150,000 below CV.\r\n\r\nPlease note: images have been virtually staged for illustrative purposes. Buyers should conduct their own due diligence and inspect the property in person.",
